{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>Your sacred pillars.</b> Towers and palaces." "<b>Your sun-idols.</b> A kind of idolatry that they set up on the roofs; and from the fact that they set them up in the sun (חַמָּה), they are called חַמָּנִים (Sifra Leviticus 19)." "<b>And I will place your carcasses.</b> They were swollen from famine, and they would take their fear out of their bosom and kiss them, and their belly would burst and fall upon them (Sifra; Sanhedrin 63)." "<b>And My soul will abhor you.</b> This is the withdrawal of the Shekhinah (Sifra)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:08:44.667890497Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}